    <briefdescription>
<para>Voice Anti-Spoofing Detection — Live vs. Synthetic Audio Detection. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="version"><para>v1.0 </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Maturity: 🟡 BETA </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Status: Wave A Batch A-8 Implementation</para>
</simplesect>
Detects and rejects spoofed audio (recordings, synthetically generated, or replayed) by analyzing three deterministic local features:</para>
<para><orderedlist>
<listitem><para><bold>Audio Freshness</bold>: Detects synthetic/recorded vs. live stream<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Spectral analysis for digital artifacts</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Live audio has natural variation; synthetic is too regular</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold>Speaker Verification</bold>: Compares against known baseline<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Voice embedding comparison (speaker recognition model)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Rejects speaker mismatch with high confidence</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold>Noise Analysis</bold>: Environmental consistency detection<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Background noise patterns must be coherent</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Detects spliced/edited audio (noise discontinuities)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<sect1 id="voice__anti__spoof__engine_8h_1autotoc_md7_1s1"><sect2 id="voice__anti__spoof__engine_8h_1autotoc_md7">
<title>Spoofing Detection Strategy</title><para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">Audio<sp/>Input</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>↓</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">[Spectral<sp/>Analysis]<sp/>→<sp/>Freshness<sp/>Score<sp/>(0-1)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>↓</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">[Speaker<sp/>Embedding<sp/>Comparison]<sp/>→<sp/>Speaker<sp/>Match<sp/>(0-1)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>↓</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">[Noise<sp/>Pattern<sp/>Analysis]<sp/>→<sp/>Noise<sp/>Consistency<sp/>(0-1)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>↓</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">[Composite<sp/>Scoring]<sp/>→<sp/>Final<sp/>Verdict</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>All<sp/>scores<sp/>&gt;<sp/>0.7<sp/>→<sp/>PASS<sp/>(likely<sp/>live)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Any<sp/>score<sp/>&lt;<sp/>0.4<sp/>→<sp/>FAIL<sp/>(likely<sp/>spoofed)</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para>@error 7200: Spoofing analysis failed @error 7201: Speaker verification failed @error 7202: Audio quality too low for analysis @error 7203: Synthetic/recorded audio detected </para>
</sect2></sect1>
